{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011CLEacgpFwPLLsmSjMJ6iQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — clkc_mech_interp\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 | 目标: ICLR 2027 (DDL ~2026-09-24)\n4\t\n5\t## Core Insight\n6\t\n7\t多语言 LLM 中，跨语言知识冲突的检测信号可在残差流中被线性探针检测，且跨语言迁移呈现**方向性不对称**（ZH→EN >> EN→ZH ~7.2pp），该不对称性跨架构高度一致（Llama-3.1-8B 与 Qwen3-8B）。这为 CLEAR (Zhao et al. 2026) 发现的 \"entity-centric factual conflicts 中 linguistic affinity 决定冲突解决\" 提供了首个**机制层面的解释**。\n8\t\n9\t**注意**: CLEAR 的发现是 task-dependent 的——entity-centric factual conflicts 由 linguistic affinity 主导，reasoning-intensive tasks 由 resource abundance 主导。我们使用 ConflictQA（entity-centric），引用 CLEAR 时必须限定为 entity-centric 场景。\n10\t\n11\t## Narrative Structure\n12\t\n13\t**现象驱动的机制解释**（非 \"applying X to Y\"）：\n14\t\n15\t1. **Phenomenon**: CLEAR 发现在 entity-centric factual conflicts 中，linguistic affinity（而非 resource abundance）决定跨语言冲突解决，但未提供机制解释\n16\t2. **Mechanistic question**: 冲突信号在模型内部如何编码？是 language-universal 还是 language-specific？为什么 similarity 起决定作用？\n17\t3. **Our answer**: 通过残差流探针、SAE 特征分析、激活干预三条互补分析轨道，揭示冲突检测信号的跨语言结构——是否共享、在哪些层出现、能否用于干预\n18\t\n19\t**Secondary framing**: SAE-based mechanistic interpretability 工具在跨语言条件下的 stress test——probing / SAE / steering 三种工具的跨语言适用性边界\n20\t\n21\t## Competing Hypotheses (pre-registered)\n22\t\n23\t**H1 — English-anchored universal detection**:\n24\t冲突检测信号本身是 language-independent 的（\"是否存在冲突\" 是语言无关判断），编码在 mid-layer 共享表征空间中。final-layer language transition 引入 similarity-dependent 干扰，影响 resolution 但不影响 detection。\n25\t- 预测: mid-layer conflict feature 跨语言 Jaccard >> late-layer Jaccard (paired permutation test p < 0.05)\n26\t- 预测: 英语探针跨语言迁移更强（英语作为训练数据主导语言，表征空间以英语为锚点）\n27\t\n28\t**H2 — Language-pair-specific encoding**:\n29\t冲突特征从 mid-layer 起即为 language-pair-specific 的，linguistic distance 直接编码在冲突表征中。\n30\t- 预测: mid-layer 和 late-layer Jaccard 无显著差异，或 mid < late\n31\t- 预测: 探针迁移准确率与语言对 typological distance 强相关\n32\t\n33\t**MVP 证据倾向**:\n34\t当前双模型结果倾向 **H1 的变体**——ZH→EN 迁移（71-72%）显著强于 EN→ZH（64-65%），暗示冲突信号以英语表征空间为锚点编码。非线性成分（MLP EN→ZH +9.2pp vs linear）提示 EN→ZH 方向的跨语言映射更复杂。\n35\t\n36\t## Core Claims\n37\t\n38\t### Claim 1: Cross-lingual conflict detectability\n39\t**Statement**: 跨语言知识冲突信号可在残差流中被线性探针检测，准确率显著高于随机基线。\n40\t**Evidence needed**:\n41\t- ≥2 model architectures 的 within-language probe acc > 70% (balanced) ✅ (Llama 77.1%, Qwen 75.3%)\n42\t- Permutation test p < 0.001 ✅ (all directions)\n43\t- Cross-lingual transfer acc > chance (50%) with statistical significance ✅ (all directions 64-72%)\n44\t**Status**: MVP 已验证 ✅\n45\t\n46\t### Claim 2: Asymmetric cross-lingual transfer\n47\t**Statement**: 跨语言探针迁移呈方向一致的不对称：ZH→EN 迁移强于 EN→ZH（~7.2pp），效果量跨架构高度一致（Llama 显著，Qwen 方向一致但未达显著）。\n48\t**Evidence needed**:\n49\t- Bootstrap CI for asymmetry gap (corrected, plan_099 ✅):\n50\t  - Llama: +7.22pp, CI [1.1%, 13.6%] — 排除零但 borderline ✅\n51\t  - Qwen: +7.18pp, CI [-1.2%, 13.4%] — 含零，方向一致 ⚠️\n52\t- ≥2 models show consistent effect size ✅ (7.22pp vs 7.18pp)\n53\t- Token overlap analysis 排除词汇重叠驱动的虚假迁移 ✅ (plan_101 完成: per-sample Jaccard 3-4%, Qwen 无相关 p>0.4, Llama 显著负相关 r=-0.15 p=0.012 — RC2 排除)\n54\t- ≥1 additional model architecture 验证跨架构一致性 ❌ (planned P0)\n55\t**Status**: 初步验证 ⚠️ (需补 token overlap + 第三模型)\n56\t\n57\t### Claim 3: Direction-dependent non-linear components\n58\t**Statement**: 跨语言冲突信号的弱迁移方向（EN→ZH）包含方向依赖的非线性成分，MLP 探针在该方向提升最大。跨架构一致方向但幅度不同（Llama +9.2pp single-seed / ~+4.7pp bootstrap-corrected, Qwen +2.3pp），暗示非线性成分与模型的跨语言对齐程度相关。\n59\t**Evidence needed**:\n60\t- MLP vs linear probe comparison on ≥2 models ✅ (both show EN→ZH direction gains)\n61\t- MLP 不使用 test set 做 early stopping ✅ (已修复)\n62\t- 控制实验排除 MLP 过拟合 ❌ (需 train/test accuracy gap 分析)\n63\t- 解释跨架构幅度差异 (Llama 4x > Qwen) ❌ (可能与 Qwen 更强的跨语言对齐有关——ZH 训练数据占比更高)\n64\t**Status**: 初步验证 ⚠️ (方向一致但幅度差异需解释)\n65\t\n66\t### Claim 4: Layer-wise conflict signal structure\n67\t**Statement**: 冲突信号在 mid-to-upper layers 集中，峰值层在不同模型架构中占比一致（Llama ~88% depth, Qwen ~67% depth 有差异——需更多模型确认 pattern）。\n68\t**Evidence needed**:\n69\t- Layer-wise probe accuracy curves for ≥3 models ❌\n70\t- Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA 量化 EN vs ZH 表征相似度 ❌\n71\t- 与 \"Lost in Multilinguality\" 的 language transition 层对比 ❌\n72\t**Status**: 未验证 ❌\n73\t\n74\t### Claim 5: Cross-lingual SAE conflict features (Track 2)\n75\t**Statement**: SAE 特征空间中存在跨语言共享的冲突编码特征，可与 language-identity 特征解耦。\n76\t**Evidence needed**:\n77\t- Qwen-Scope SAE 特征分析 on Qwen3-8B-Base ❌\n78\t- LangFIR random-token filtering 控制 ❌\n79\t- Cross-lingual feature Jaccard 分析 ❌\n80\t**Status**: 未开始 ❌\n81\t\n82\t### Claim 6: Cross-lingual conflict steering (Track 3)\n83\t**Statement**: 通过 SAE 特征干预可以定向操控跨语言冲突解决行为。\n84\t**Evidence needed**:\n85\t- SpARE 框架跨语言扩展 ❌\n86\t- Monolingual → cross-lingual steering transfer ❌\n87\t- Steering effectiveness vs linguistic distance correlation ❌\n88\t**Status**: 未开始 ❌ (依赖 Track 2)\n89\t\n90\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n91\t\n92\t### RC1: Translation quality confound [RESOLVED ✅]\n93\t**Concern**: 中文翻译质量差可能导致虚假的冲突信号或迁移失败\n94\t**Result**: Plan_105 COMET tercile ablation 证明翻译质量非 confounder。Qwen test: Low COMET (mean 0.585) → 66.35% acc, High COMET (mean 0.816) → 60.71% acc, delta=-5.64pp (反向), Fisher p=0.695。冲突信号检测不依赖翻译质量。Back-translation COMET ≥0.80 阈值过严（两步翻译天然拉低），但 ablation 实证排除了翻译质量 confound。\n95\t**Remaining**: Llama test COMET 完成后重复此分析确认一致性。\n96\t\n97\t### RC2: Token overlap confound [RESOLVED ✅]\n98\t**Concern**: 跨语言迁移可能由 EN-ZH 共享 token（数字、专有名词、标点）驱动\n99\t**Result**: Per-sample Jaccard 仅 3-4%（type-level 10-15% 被膨胀）。Qwen 无相关 (p>0.4)，Llama 显著负相关 (r=-0.15, p=0.012, tercile Δ=-23.9pp)。高 overlap 反而降低准确率，方向与 RC2 相反。**共享 token 不驱动跨语言迁移，迁移发生在语义表示层。**\n100\t\n101\t### RC3: Model coverage insufficient [HIGH]\n102\t**Concern**: 只有 2 个模型，无法声称 \"架构无关\"\n103\t**Mitigation**: 加 ≥1 不同架构（Mistral/Gemma），验证 ~7.2pp 不对称性\n104\t**Experiment**: P0 — additional model verification\n105\t\n106\t### RC4: Dataset size and diversity [MEDIUM]\n107\t**Concern**: ConflictQA 覆盖面有限（~1000 samples/model），只有 EN-ZH 一个语言对\n108\t**Mitigation**: Phase 1 聚焦 EN-ZH 验证核心机制，Phase 2 扩展多语言（≥1 额外语言对）\n109\t**Experiment**: P0 — multilingual extension (EN↔JA or EN↔DE)\n110\t\n111\t### RC5: Linear probe expressiveness [LOW]\n112\t**Concern**: 线性探针可能遗漏复杂非线性信号\n113\t**Mitigation**: MLP 对比实验已完成 ✅，非线性成分已量化\n114\t**Experiment**: Done — MLP vs Linear comparison\n115\t\n116\t### RC6: SAE base/instruct mismatch [MEDIUM]\n117\t**Concern**: Qwen-Scope SAE 训练在 base model 上，用于 instruct model 分析可能失配\n118\t**Mitigation**: Track 2 用 base model 做 SAE 分析 + 与 Track 1 instruct probe 交叉验证\n119\t**Experiment**: Track 2 设计已考虑\n120\t\n121\t### RC7: Steering failure precedent [MEDIUM]\n122\t**Concern**: \"Interpretability without actionability\" 证明 SAE steering 可能完全无效\n123\t**Mitigation**: 知识冲突与临床分诊的 5 维差异（SpARE 已证明知识冲突场景 steering 有效）；Track 3 显式报告失败模式\n124\t**Experiment**: Track 3 包含 negative result framing\n125\t\n126\t### RC8: Causal claims without intervention [HIGH]\n127\t**Concern**: 探针只证明信号可检测，不证明因果关系\n128\t**Mitigation**: Track 3 steering 实验提供因果证据；Track 1 permutation test 提供统计控制\n129\t**Experiment**: Track 3 steering + representation steering (P1)\n130\t\n131\t## Paper Structure (Tentative)\n132\t\n133\t1. **Introduction**: CLEAR gap → mechanistic question → H1 vs H2 → three-track approach → key findings preview\n134\t2. **Related Work**: Monolingual conflict mechanisms → Cross-lingual processing → SAE steering (successes & failures) → Cross-lingual SAE features\n135\t3. **Method**: Data construction (ConflictQA + translation + verification pipeline) → Track 1 probing → Track 2 SAE analysis → Track 3 steering\n136\t4. **Experiments & Results**:\n137\t   - 4.1 Cross-lingual conflict detectability (C1)\n138\t   - 4.2 Asymmetric transfer analysis (C2) + token overlap controls\n139\t   - 4.3 Non-linear components (C3) + layer-wise structure (C4)\n140\t   - 4.4 SAE feature analysis (C5) [if Track 2 ready]\n141\t   - 4.5 Steering experiments (C6) [if Track 3 ready]\n142\t5. **Discussion**: H1 vs H2 resolution → mechanism implications → limitations → connection to CLEAR\n143\t6. **Conclusion**\n144\t\n145\t## Scope Control\n146\t\n147\t**投稿最低要求 (must-have for submission)**:\n148\t- Claims 1-3 fully supported (cross-lingual detectability + asymmetry + non-linearity)\n149\t- Claim 4 partially supported (layer-wise analysis on ≥2 models)\n150\t- ≥3 model architectures\n151\t- ≥2 language pairs (EN-ZH + one more)\n152\t- Token overlap control\n153\t- COMET translation quality validation\n154\t\n155\t**理想状态 (nice-to-have)**:\n156\t- Track 2 SAE analysis (Claim 5)\n157\t- Track 3 steering (Claim 6)\n158\t- 5+ language pairs covering multiple typological families\n159\t- Full CKA/SVCCA layer analysis\n160\t\n161\t**不做 (out of scope)**:\n162\t- 10-language full CLEAR replication\n163\t- Custom SAE training\n164\t- MoE model analysis\n165\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d7df02c-9d3f-4b1a-a213-f80ea487c62d","uuid":"e028c444-2d77-45ec-998f-1567106bf52e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T02:56:52.836Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod42/projects/clkc_mech_interp/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T023801/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — clkc_mech_interp\n\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 | 目标: ICLR 2027 (DDL ~2026-09-24)\n\n## Core Insight\n\n多语言 LLM 中，跨语言知识冲突的检测信号可在残差流中被线性探针检测，且跨语言迁移呈现**方向性不对称**（ZH→EN >> EN→ZH ~7.2pp），该不对称性跨架构高度一致（Llama-3.1-8B 与 Qwen3-8B）。这为 CLEAR (Zhao et al. 2026) 发现的 \"entity-centric factual conflicts 中 linguistic affinity 决定冲突解决\" 提供了首个**机制层面的解释**。\n\n**注意**: CLEAR 的发现是 task-dependent 的——entity-centric factual conflicts 由 linguistic affinity 主导，reasoning-intensive tasks 由 resource abundance 主导。我们使用 ConflictQA（entity-centric），引用 CLEAR 时必须限定为 entity-centric 场景。\n\n## Narrative Structure\n\n**现象驱动的机制解释**（非 \"applying X to Y\"）：\n\n1. **Phenomenon**: CLEAR 发现在 entity-centric factual conflicts 中，linguistic affinity（而非 resource abundance）决定跨语言冲突解决，但未提供机制解释\n2. **Mechanistic question**: 冲突信号在模型内部如何编码？是 language-universal 还是 language-specific？为什么 similarity 起决定作用？\n3. **Our answer**: 通过残差流探针、SAE 特征分析、激活干预三条互补分析轨道，揭示冲突检测信号的跨语言结构——是否共享、在哪些层出现、能否用于干预\n\n**Secondary framing**: SAE-based mechanistic interpretability 工具在跨语言条件下的 stress test——probing / SAE / steering 三种工具的跨语言适用性边界\n\n## Competing Hypotheses (pre-registered)\n\n**H1 — English-anchored universal detection**:\n冲突检测信号本身是 language-independent 的（\"是否存在冲突\" 是语言无关判断），编码在 mid-layer 共享表征空间中。final-layer language transition 引入 similarity-dependent 干扰，影响 resolution 但不影响 detection。\n- 预测: mid-layer conflict feature 跨语言 Jaccard >> late-layer Jaccard (paired permutation test p < 0.05)\n- 预测: 英语探针跨语言迁移更强（英语作为训练数据主导语言，表征空间以英语为锚点）\n\n**H2 — Language-pair-specific encoding**:\n冲突特征从 mid-layer 起即为 language-pair-specific 的，linguistic distance 直接编码在冲突表征中。\n- 预测: mid-layer 和 late-layer Jaccard 无显著差异，或 mid < late\n- 预测: 探针迁移准确率与语言对 typological distance 强相关\n\n**MVP 证据倾向**:\n当前双模型结果倾向 **H1 的变体**——ZH→EN 迁移（71-72%）显著强于 EN→ZH（64-65%），暗示冲突信号以英语表征空间为锚点编码。非线性成分（MLP EN→ZH +9.2pp vs linear）提示 EN→ZH 方向的跨语言映射更复杂。\n\n## Core Claims\n\n### Claim 1: Cross-lingual conflict detectability\n**Statement**: 跨语言知识冲突信号可在残差流中被线性探针检测，准确率显著高于随机基线。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- ≥2 model architectures 的 within-language probe acc > 70% (balanced) ✅ (Llama 77.1%, Qwen 75.3%)\n- Permutation test p < 0.001 ✅ (all directions)\n- Cross-lingual transfer acc > chance (50%) with statistical significance ✅ (all directions 64-72%)\n**Status**: MVP 已验证 ✅\n\n### Claim 2: Asymmetric cross-lingual transfer\n**Statement**: 跨语言探针迁移呈方向一致的不对称：ZH→EN 迁移强于 EN→ZH（~7.2pp），效果量跨架构高度一致（Llama 显著，Qwen 方向一致但未达显著）。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- Bootstrap CI for asymmetry gap (corrected, plan_099 ✅):\n  - Llama: +7.22pp, CI [1.1%, 13.6%] — 排除零但 borderline ✅\n  - Qwen: +7.18pp, CI [-1.2%, 13.4%] — 含零，方向一致 ⚠️\n- ≥2 models show consistent effect size ✅ (7.22pp vs 7.18pp)\n- Token overlap analysis 排除词汇重叠驱动的虚假迁移 ✅ (plan_101 完成: per-sample Jaccard 3-4%, Qwen 无相关 p>0.4, Llama 显著负相关 r=-0.15 p=0.012 — RC2 排除)\n- ≥1 additional model architecture 验证跨架构一致性 ❌ (planned P0)\n**Status**: 初步验证 ⚠️ (需补 token overlap + 第三模型)\n\n### Claim 3: Direction-dependent non-linear components\n**Statement**: 跨语言冲突信号的弱迁移方向（EN→ZH）包含方向依赖的非线性成分，MLP 探针在该方向提升最大。跨架构一致方向但幅度不同（Llama +9.2pp single-seed / ~+4.7pp bootstrap-corrected, Qwen +2.3pp），暗示非线性成分与模型的跨语言对齐程度相关。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- MLP vs linear probe comparison on ≥2 models ✅ (both show EN→ZH direction gains)\n- MLP 不使用 test set 做 early stopping ✅ (已修复)\n- 控制实验排除 MLP 过拟合 ❌ (需 train/test accuracy gap 分析)\n- 解释跨架构幅度差异 (Llama 4x > Qwen) ❌ (可能与 Qwen 更强的跨语言对齐有关——ZH 训练数据占比更高)\n**Status**: 初步验证 ⚠️ (方向一致但幅度差异需解释)\n\n### Claim 4: Layer-wise conflict signal structure\n**Statement**: 冲突信号在 mid-to-upper layers 集中，峰值层在不同模型架构中占比一致（Llama ~88% depth, Qwen ~67% depth 有差异——需更多模型确认 pattern）。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- Layer-wise probe accuracy curves for ≥3 models ❌\n- Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA 量化 EN vs ZH 表征相似度 ❌\n- 与 \"Lost in Multilinguality\" 的 language transition 层对比 ❌\n**Status**: 未验证 ❌\n\n### Claim 5: Cross-lingual SAE conflict features (Track 2)\n**Statement**: SAE 特征空间中存在跨语言共享的冲突编码特征，可与 language-identity 特征解耦。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- Qwen-Scope SAE 特征分析 on Qwen3-8B-Base ❌\n- LangFIR random-token filtering 控制 ❌\n- Cross-lingual feature Jaccard 分析 ❌\n**Status**: 未开始 ❌\n\n### Claim 6: Cross-lingual conflict steering (Track 3)\n**Statement**: 通过 SAE 特征干预可以定向操控跨语言冲突解决行为。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- SpARE 框架跨语言扩展 ❌\n- Monolingual → cross-lingual steering transfer ❌\n- Steering effectiveness vs linguistic distance correlation ❌\n**Status**: 未开始 ❌ (依赖 Track 2)\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### RC1: Translation quality confound [RESOLVED ✅]\n**Concern**: 中文翻译质量差可能导致虚假的冲突信号或迁移失败\n**Result**: Plan_105 COMET tercile ablation 证明翻译质量非 confounder。Qwen test: Low COMET (mean 0.585) → 66.35% acc, High COMET (mean 0.816) → 60.71% acc, delta=-5.64pp (反向), Fisher p=0.695。冲突信号检测不依赖翻译质量。Back-translation COMET ≥0.80 阈值过严（两步翻译天然拉低），但 ablation 实证排除了翻译质量 confound。\n**Remaining**: Llama test COMET 完成后重复此分析确认一致性。\n\n### RC2: Token overlap confound [RESOLVED ✅]\n**Concern**: 跨语言迁移可能由 EN-ZH 共享 token（数字、专有名词、标点）驱动\n**Result**: Per-sample Jaccard 仅 3-4%（type-level 10-15% 被膨胀）。Qwen 无相关 (p>0.4)，Llama 显著负相关 (r=-0.15, p=0.012, tercile Δ=-23.9pp)。高 overlap 反而降低准确率，方向与 RC2 相反。**共享 token 不驱动跨语言迁移，迁移发生在语义表示层。**\n\n### RC3: Model coverage insufficient [HIGH]\n**Concern**: 只有 2 个模型，无法声称 \"架构无关\"\n**Mitigation**: 加 ≥1 不同架构（Mistral/Gemma），验证 ~7.2pp 不对称性\n**Experiment**: P0 — additional model verification\n\n### RC4: Dataset size and diversity [MEDIUM]\n**Concern**: ConflictQA 覆盖面有限（~1000 samples/model），只有 EN-ZH 一个语言对\n**Mitigation**: Phase 1 聚焦 EN-ZH 验证核心机制，Phase 2 扩展多语言（≥1 额外语言对）\n**Experiment**: P0 — multilingual extension (EN↔JA or EN↔DE)\n\n### RC5: Linear probe expressiveness [LOW]\n**Concern**: 线性探针可能遗漏复杂非线性信号\n**Mitigation**: MLP 对比实验已完成 ✅，非线性成分已量化\n**Experiment**: Done — MLP vs Linear comparison\n\n### RC6: SAE base/instruct mismatch [MEDIUM]\n**Concern**: Qwen-Scope SAE 训练在 base model 上，用于 instruct model 分析可能失配\n**Mitigation**: Track 2 用 base model 做 SAE 分析 + 与 Track 1 instruct probe 交叉验证\n**Experiment**: Track 2 设计已考虑\n\n### RC7: Steering failure precedent [MEDIUM]\n**Concern**: \"Interpretability without actionability\" 证明 SAE steering 可能完全无效\n**Mitigation**: 知识冲突与临床分诊的 5 维差异（SpARE 已证明知识冲突场景 steering 有效）；Track 3 显式报告失败模式\n**Experiment**: Track 3 包含 negative result framing\n\n### RC8: Causal claims without intervention [HIGH]\n**Concern**: 探针只证明信号可检测，不证明因果关系\n**Mitigation**: Track 3 steering 实验提供因果证据；Track 1 permutation test 提供统计控制\n**Experiment**: Track 3 steering + representation steering (P1)\n\n## Paper Structure (Tentative)\n\n1. **Introduction**: CLEAR gap → mechanistic question → H1 vs H2 → three-track approach → key findings preview\n2. **Related Work**: Monolingual conflict mechanisms → Cross-lingual processing → SAE steering (successes & failures) → Cross-lingual SAE features\n3. **Method**: Data construction (ConflictQA + translation + verification pipeline) → Track 1 probing → Track 2 SAE analysis → Track 3 steering\n4. **Experiments & Results**:\n   - 4.1 Cross-lingual conflict detectability (C1)\n   - 4.2 Asymmetric transfer analysis (C2) + token overlap controls\n   - 4.3 Non-linear components (C3) + layer-wise structure (C4)\n   - 4.4 SAE feature analysis (C5) [if Track 2 ready]\n   - 4.5 Steering experiments (C6) [if Track 3 ready]\n5. **Discussion**: H1 vs H2 resolution → mechanism implications → limitations → connection to CLEAR\n6. **Conclusion**\n\n## Scope Control\n\n**投稿最低要求 (must-have for submission)**:\n- Claims 1-3 fully supported (cross-lingual detectability + asymmetry + non-linearity)\n- Claim 4 partially supported (layer-wise analysis on ≥2 models)\n- ≥3 model architectures\n- ≥2 language pairs (EN-ZH + one more)\n- Token overlap control\n- COMET translation quality validation\n\n**理想状态 (nice-to-have)**:\n- Track 2 SAE analysis (Claim 5)\n- Track 3 steering (Claim 6)\n- 5+ language pairs covering multiple typological families\n- Full CKA/SVCCA layer analysis\n\n**不做 (out of scope)**:\n- 10-language full CLEAR replication\n- Custom SAE training\n- MoE model analysis\n","numLines":165,"startLine":1,"totalLines":165}}}
